    "Scan of the 1963 edition of the Mentor, Ohio, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1953; aerial photographs from 1977; field checked in 1963; photo revised in 1979; last revised in 1979; printed in 1979.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.1 x 30.2 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
